WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.229
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BY NOW YOU HAVE

00:00:07.428 --> 00:00:10.064
HEARD THE CRUSHING NEWS ABOUT

00:00:08.362 --> 00:00:10.831
OUR COLLEAGUE AND DEAR FRIEND

00:00:10.197 --> 00:00:13.033
CHARLES KRAUTHAMMER.

00:00:10.965 --> 00:00:14.535
I HAVE ONLY A FEW WEEKS LEFT

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:15.870
TO LIVE, CHARLES WROTE IN ONE

00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:17.638
OF HIS FINAL LETTERS.

00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:18.873
THIS IS THE FINAL VERDICT.

00:00:17.771 --> 00:00:20.174
MY FIGHT IS OVER."

00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:22.776
OVER THE COMING DAYS CHARLES

00:00:20.307 --> 00:00:24.378
WILL BE CELEBRATE AND

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.146
ULTIMATELY EULOGIZED BY THOSE

00:00:24.512 --> 00:00:26.280
WHO KNEW HIM.

00:00:25.279 --> 00:00:27.281
FOR GENERATIONS HE WILL

00:00:26.413 --> 00:00:28.649
CONTINUE TO TOUCH AND GUIDE

00:00:27.414 --> 00:00:31.185
THOSE WHO DIDN'T KNOW HIM.

00:00:28.782 --> 00:00:33.053
HIS WORDS CLEAR AND CRISP AND

00:00:31.318 --> 00:00:34.655
TRUE WILL LONG OUTLIVE HIM.

00:00:33.187 --> 00:00:35.389
A LOT WILL BE SAID ABOUT

00:00:34.788 --> 00:00:36.891
CHARLES KRAUTHAMMER.

00:00:35.523 --> 00:00:38.492
I WOULD LIKE TO ADD ONE THING.

00:00:37.024 --> 00:00:39.793
OVER THE MORE THAN 20 YEARS I

00:00:38.626 --> 00:00:40.628
KNEW HIM, CHARLES THOUGHT

00:00:39.927 --> 00:00:42.363
ABOUT DEATH EVERY DAY.

00:00:40.761 --> 00:00:46.834
HE TOLD ME THAT ONCE.

00:00:42.496 --> 00:00:47.768
IF THAT SOUNDS MORE -- MOROSE,

00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:49.336
IT'S THE OPPOSITE.

00:00:47.902 --> 00:00:51.071
HE WAS ONE OF THE RARE PEOPLE

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:53.641
WITH THE COURAGE TO LOOK

00:00:51.205 --> 00:00:55.309
REALITY SQUARELY IN THE FACE.

00:00:53.774 --> 00:00:55.743
CHARLES RADIATED A CALM

00:00:55.442 --> 00:00:56.844
CHEERFULNESS.

00:00:55.876 --> 00:00:57.945
HE KNEW WHAT WAS COMING.

00:00:56.977 --> 00:00:58.312
HE HAD BEEN CLOSE TO IT

00:00:58.078 --> 00:01:00.381
BEFORE.

00:00:58.445 --> 00:01:03.150
HE DIDN'T WANT TO LEAVE, BUT

00:01:00.514 --> 00:01:04.752
IT DIDN'T SCARE HIM.

00:01:03.284 --> 00:01:05.486
CHARLES KRAUTHAMMER IS A

00:01:04.885 --> 00:01:08.122
GENUINELY BRAVE MAN.

00:01:05.619 --> 00:01:08.689
FOR THAT REASON, HE IS A HAPPY

00:01:08.255 --> 00:01:10.491
MAN.

00:01:08.822 --> 00:01:11.425
"I LIVE THE LIFE THAT I

00:01:10.624 --> 00:01:13.360
INTENDED," HE WROTE.

00:01:11.559 --> 00:01:14.461
"THERE IS NO HIGHER

00:01:13.494 --> 00:01:14.962
ACHIEVEMENT THAN THAT."

00:01:14.595 --> 00:01:18.766
GOOD NIGHT.

00:01:15.095 --> 00:01:18.766
HAVE A GREAT WEEKEND.

